<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <style>
        body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; background-color: #f4f7f6; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 20px auto; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 8px; background-color: #fff; }
        .header { background-color: rgba(16, 25, 196, 0.81); color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; }
        .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; }
        .content { padding: 30px 20px; }
        .content p { margin: 0 0 15px; }
        .footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: #888; }
        a { color: rgba(16, 25, 196, 0.81); }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>NuurPath Travels</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <h2>Booking Confirmation</h2>
            <p>Dear <%= data.user.name %>,</p>
            <p>Your booking for the package "<b><%= data.package.title %></b>" has been confirmed.</p>
            <p>We look forward to providing you with an excellent travel experience.</p>
            <p>Sincerely,<br>The NuurPath Travels Team</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>